{
  "meta": {
    "slug": "vsync",
    "title": "VSYNC：HWC 上报 → 预测 → 两相分发 → Choreographer",
    "subtitle": "从 composer HAL 上报硬件 vsync 开始：VSyncReactor 校准、VSyncPredictor 预测网格、VSyncDispatchTimerQueue 武装 timerfd，把 app 与 sf 两相唤醒算成两个 workDuration，最后落到 EventThread/MessageQueue 与 Choreographer 的 doFrame",
    "version": "android17-release",
    "built": "2026-11-26",
    "git_ref": "24bc82b5d",
    "repo": "AOSP_Frameworks",
    "summary": "只讲 VSYNC 这条：HAL 的 onComposerHalVsync 进 SF（持 mStateLock），HWComposer::onVsync 去重后交给 VsyncSchedule，VSyncReactor 做周期确认与 present fence 采样，VSyncPredictor 用线性回归给出目标 vsync 网格；VSyncDispatch 把 (vsync, workDuration, readyDuration) 折算成 timerfd 唤醒，TimerDispatch 线程在同一窗口内批量回调；app 侧 EventThread 按连接限流（phases/rate）后经 BitTube 投递，Java 侧 Choreographer 收包、修 jitter、按 CALLBACK_INPUT→ANIMATION→TRAVERSAL→COMMIT 分发；sf 侧 MessageQueue 生成 vsyncId 后交给 Scheduler::onFrameSignal。相位差被折算成两个 duration，不存在独立的 phaseOffset 参与调度。",
    "kicker": "AOSP · android17-release · VSync pipeline"
  },
